# Current Locks' bypass culvert (CIPlay current_locks_caves, 11-12 w08; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its
# recipe: the mouth in the canal's bank at -3 3 (2 m down), the culvert climbing (12 deg) under the bank to the keeper's
# dry room round -31.2 -7.2 (air zone cl_culvert, the bypass keeper's chest at -33.8 -5.5).
# Walked in from the canal floor, air taken, the chest opened, walked back out to the canal.
island Current Locks keep
offset 1.8515 -0.7961
hour 11
weather Calm
where Loot_ChestSmall
where Zone_Trigger

picture cl_cave_out 1.5 -0.5 4.6 -3 -1.5 3
walk -0.5 3.9 to -3 3 to -9.6 0.6 to -16.2 -1.8 to -23.1 -4.3 to -30.5 -7 below=-1
air cl_culvert here
picture cl_cave_in -26 4 -5.2 -33.8 3 -5.5
picture cl_cave_back -31 4 -7 -16 1 -1.8 light=20
open Bypass keeper's chest
wait 3
expect item Rope 2
walk -30.5 -7 to -23.1 -4.3 to -16.2 -1.8 to -9.6 0.6 to -3 3 to -0.5 3.9 below=5
